Unprocess Camera

This project is based on unprocess by Reiland Eubank:
https://github.com/reilandeubank/unprocess

The original unprocess project is based on Android Camera2Basic:
https://github.com/android/camera-samples/tree/main/Camera2Basic

Original Git history and copyright and license notices in source files are retained.
This continuation adds a redesigned camera interface, touch focus and exposure,
flash and Pro controls, RAW-derived JPEG capture, and an in-app gallery.

